 He and Om Prakash Verma and Liang Wang and Shangzhe Di and Kristian Simonato and Wangkai Li and Limin Wang and Fei Xie and Fei Wang and Chang Liu and Bin Yan and Qianjin Yu and Hui Li and Roman P. Pflugfelder and Xiao Li and Shengyong Chen and Xi Li and Zhenhua Feng and Xiaoyun Yang and Haibin Ling and Jianfeng He and Chao Sun and Huchuan Lu and Song Yan and Zizheng Xun and Qiang Wang and Deepak Jangid and Payman Moallem and Hyung Jin Chang and Ben Kang and Benjamin Dzubur and Ales Leonardis and Xilin Chen and Shiguang Shan and Joni-Kristian Kämäräinen and Ming Li and Jiri Matas and Josef Kittler},
